# Docs
site/
# Exercise/quiz JSON is regenerated on every build and would churn the
# tree. The figures are tracked instead, so a build environment without
# matplotlib (Cloudflare's installs only mkdocs-material and pyyaml)
# still has them, and any drift shows up as a reviewable diff.
docs/assets/generated/*
!docs/assets/generated/figures/

